      "value": "Personally if you want to be different make an avatar... Not everyone knows how but in my eyes if you’re willing to pay for ingame stuff you can probably pay someone to make you an avatar. This is similar to people wanting a rank above trusted user. The ranks don’t matter about who you talk to nor does how you look in game. It’s about the experiences of the game and people playing with you doesn’t matter what their avatar is. I agree with others on minimizing the amount of segregation in the game we can cause.",
